# Force LF on checkout regardless of each teammate's local core.autocrlf.
# versioning.py hashes raw file bytes (system_prompt.md, tools.yaml) to build
# artifact_version; if checkout line endings differ per machine (CRLF on
# Windows with autocrlf=true vs LF elsewhere), the SAME committed content
# hashes differently across teammates, breaking version comparisons.
* text=auto eol=lf
